Error [jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch]: `#StepLimit(0)` allows no compile-time step
  --> Tests/UI/comptime_step_limit_zero_is_refused.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | #StepLimit(0)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The step limit bounds the compile-time work of the binding's value, so it is at least 1
 Fix: Write the most steps the value may take, such as `#StepLimit(20000000)`; without the marker the limit is 10000000
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0930
